    "request": {
      "op": "say",
      "text": "Please build a polished, mobile-friendly static website for fictional Taco Cometa that helps a first-time visitor quickly decide what to eat and how to visit. The desired customer outcome: feel hungry, understand the sample menu, and know the next step for an in-person visit. Include a welcoming hero, a small clearly labeled sample menu with prices, sample location/hours marked as fictional, and a simple visit/contact section. Use clear navigation and strong readable type; no ordering, payment, analytics, data collection, or unsupported real-world claims. All names, dishes, prices, address and hours are sample content."
